            "content": "## ⚠️ Emarsys API credential setup\n\nEvery endpoint permission of an Emarsys API credential is **disabled by default**.\nThis flow reads `/field/translate/en`, so the credential of the connected account needs the\n`field.list` permission (Emarsys > Management > Security Settings > API Credentials).\n\nNo test data is required - every Emarsys account has contact field definitions."
